{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22209","headline":"春游二林寺 · 白居易","name":"春游二林寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"下马二林寺，翛然进轻策。\n朝爲公府吏，暮作灵山客。\n二月匡庐北，冰雪始消释。\n阳丛抽茗芽，阴窦泄泉脉。\n熙熙风土暖，蔼蔼云岚积。\n散作万壑春，凝爲一气碧。\n身闲易飘泊，官散无牵迫。\n缅彼十八人，古今同此适。\n是年淮寇起，处处兴兵革。\n智士劳思谋，戎臣苦征役。\n独有不才者，山中弄泉石。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}